        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 17.9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myvcgatpbs2q",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Important, but not unexpected, finding that experts working with AI agents are swayed by the positions of the AI, even if they think they aren't.\n\nIf your independent judgement matters on a task, you need to be deliberate about when in the process to bring in AI. www.anthropic.com/research/age...",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3myvcgatpbs2q",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-27T22:37:45.931Z",
      "likes": 71,
      "replies": 9,
      "reposts": 14,
      "score": 6.8,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 14.2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3myuv4onqt22z",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "The end of detailed summarized thinking traces for Claude and ChatGPT (likely both for anti-distillation & to simplify UX) has made being a human in the loop challenging. It pushes us towards automation, rather than augmentation, as it has become much harder to weigh in on in-process AI work.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3myuv4onqt22z",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-27T18:39:46.228Z",
